Rejected after full-paper review and adversarial testing.

The inverse-generated UDG family passed generation and exact verification, but failed Track A hardness: a domain-standard exact set-cover branch-and-bound recovered valid witnesses on 4/8 shipping seeds, taking 184–288,764 nodes on successful cases. The 0/3 LLM result cannot override G6.

Track B was also unsuitable because no compact route was found: reconstructing the 180-vertex UDG alone requires 16,110 distance tests.

